Modifications made for zuregex, recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE:

    0001-split-compile-error-texts.patch
        Splits the compile error message list in src/pcre2_error.c into
        two string literals, so neither exceeds the length ISO C99
        requires compilers to support. No message changes.

No other file in src/vendor/pcre2/ is modified. src/vendor/pcre2/src/pcre2.h
and src/vendor/pcre2/src/pcre2_chartables.c are upstream's pcre2.h.generic
and pcre2_chartables.c.dist, renamed as PCRE2's NON-AUTOTOOLS-BUILD directs.
